-- that follows re-exports transitively from one that special-cases depth 1 — and the
-- method-table analogue (`reexportedMethodNames`) states in its own comment that the
-- dependency-first fold exists so "a >1-hop chain still resolves". Pinning only depth 1
-- would leave the chain claim untested.
import lib.obl1114_reexp2.{f}

main = println (f "abc")
